  <body>
    <div>
      <p begin="00:11.800" end="00:14.420" ttm:agent="v1">I don't belong with big names</p>
      <p begin="00:14.420" end="00:18.640" ttm:agent="v1">Nor do I care 'bout fancy numbers</p>
      <p begin="00:18.640" end="00:21.640" ttm:agent="v1">And I don't like jewels</p>
      <p begin="00:21.640" end="00:25.040" ttm:agent="v1">It doesn't shine on my fingers</p>
      <p begin="00:25.040" end="00:31.310" ttm:agent="v1">I hate to be at fancy parties</p>
      <p begin="00:31.310" end="00:37.060" ttm:agent="v1">I don't care anymore</p>
      <p begin="00:37.060" end="00:45.060" ttm:agent="v1">You'd call me a loser, oh</p>
      <p begin="00:45.480" end="00:50.960" ttm:agent="v1">Why won't you compromise</p>
      <p begin="00:50.960" end="00:58.090" ttm:agent="v1">I'd rather give you an F</p>
      <p begin="00:58.090" end="01:01.570" ttm:agent="v1">Fuck you, I am saying</p>
      <p begin="01:01.570" end="01:06.050" ttm:agent="v1">No, I wanna stay</p>
      <p begin="01:06.050" end="01:09.090" ttm:agent="v1">With no subtle change</p>
      <p begin="01:09.090" end="01:14.340" ttm:agent="v1">No lies over me</p>
      <p begin="01:14.340" end="01:18.620" ttm:agent="v1">No, I wouldn't be ashamed</p>
      <p begin="01:18.620" end="01:22.020" ttm:agent="v1">'Cause I already have</p>
      <p begin="01:22.020" end="01:30.020" ttm:agent="v1">Everything for me</p>
      <p begin="01:40.380" end="01:45.570" ttm:agent="v1">Maybe I'm losing</p>
      <p begin="01:45.570" end="01:51.940" ttm:agent="v1">Losing me to hold a smile, to bear it all</p>
      <p begin="01:51.940" end="01:59.660" ttm:agent="v1">How can I fail, compromise, and lose myself?</p>
      <p begin="01:59.660" end="02:03.150" ttm:agent="v1">So boy, I'm gonna smile</p>
      <p begin="02:03.150" end="02:06.440" ttm:agent="v1">Fuck you, I am saying</p>
      <p begin="02:06.440" end="02:09.310" ttm:agent="v1">Fuck you, I am saying</p>
      <p begin="02:09.310" end="02:13.860" ttm:agent="v1">No, I wanna stay</p>
      <p begin="02:13.860" end="02:17.210" ttm:agent="v1">With no subtle change</p>
      <p begin="02:17.210" end="02:22.670" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="role" itunes:value="background">No liеs over me (lies over me, over me)</p>
      <p begin="02:22.670" end="02:26.830" ttm:agent="v1">No, I wouldn't be ashamеd</p>
      <p begin="02:26.830" end="02:30.080" ttm:agent="v1">'Cause I already have</p>
      <p begin="02:30.080" end="02:35.810" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="role" itunes:value="background">Everything for me (everything for me, yeah)</p>
      <p begin="02:35.810" end="02:41.940" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="role" itunes:value="background">No, say no (yeah, yeah)</p>
      <p begin="02:41.940" end="02:48.420" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="role" itunes:value="background">No, say no (say no, say no, say no, yeah)</p>
      <p begin="02:48.420" end="02:55.310" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="role" itunes:value="background">No, say no (oh-ooh-oh)</p>
      <p begin="02:55.310" end="03:02.860" ttm:agent="v1">No, say no</p>
